1
00:00:00,400 --> 00:00:03,644
Writing good questions for every book takes time.

2
00:00:03,644 --> 00:00:05,564
Now Shelfie can suggest them.

3
00:00:05,564 --> 00:00:08,609
On Manage book, Dad presses Suggest questions.

4
00:00:09,439 --> 00:00:12,288
A short list of ideas for this book appears.

5
00:00:12,288 --> 00:00:17,079
Nothing is added until Dad ticks it, and every idea can be reworded first.

6
00:00:17,919 --> 00:00:21,356
He ticks two, changes the wording of one, and adds them.

7
00:00:21,356 --> 00:00:25,959
They join the book's questions, and Nia answers them from her next chapter.

8
00:00:26,799 --> 00:00:33,649
If the assistant is ever unavailable, Dad is told plainly, and he can still write his own questions as before.

